                <tr style="height:9.9pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;"><strong>Bu andan itibaren geri d&ouml;n&uuml;ş işlemlerinizle gelmiş olduğunuz havayolu şirketi veya yer hizmeti veren şirket ilgilenecektir.</strong></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:9.9pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:7.5pt;">From this point forward, the airline or the ground services provider will be responsible for managing the procedures related to your return.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle; background-color:#d9d9d9;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;"><strong>U&ccedil;uşunuza kadarki herhangi bir zamanda havayolu şirketinin planlamasını beklemeden kendi imkanlarınızla kendi &uuml;lkenize veya kabul edilebileceğiniz başka bir &uuml;lkeye havayolu şirketlerinin kabul etmesi halinde gitme hakkına sahipsiniz.</strong></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;">Subject to approval by the airline companies, you have the option to arrange your return to your home country or any other nation where you are granted entry by your own means. You are not required to wait for the airline company to make these arrangements, and you may choose a date that suits you best.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:9.9pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;"><strong>U&ccedil;uş zamanınıza kadar yemek i&ccedil;mek gibi ihtiya&ccedil;larınız bu şirketler tarafından karşılanacaktır.</strong></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:9.9pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:7.5pt;">Your basic needs, such as food and beverages, will be covered by these companies until your flight.</p>
                    </td>
