                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;">To inform your relatives or to make other calls, you can make use of the payphones located at the guesthouse entrance, which are equipped for international and long-distance calls and accept credit cards or phone cards.</p>
