                    <td style="width:488.6pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;">During your stay at the airport, an officer from the airport&apos;s private security company will assist and accompany you. You may ask this security guard for assistance if you need anything.</p>
